 "strokeWidth": 2.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "x": 2090, "y": 368, "strokeColor": "#4263eb", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "width": 30, "height": 0, "seed": 259708578, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [30, 0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": {"elementId": "w0aghbsvfqgx", "focus": 0, "gap": 6}, "endBinding": {"elementId": "02bgarjq9lql", "focus": 0, "gap": 6}, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1745916158, "isDeleted": false, "id": "qge8ae6apt7v", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "x": 140, "y": 577, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "width": 740, "height": 300, "seed": 241981229, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1402583871, "isDeleted": false, "id": "mdilaot48o9z", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "x": 156, "y": 591, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "width": 708, "height": 26, "seed": 1980038409, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "YA EXISTE (construido en el repo)", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": null, "originalText": "YA EXISTE (construido en el repo)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 14}, {"type": "text", "version": 1, "versionNonce": 372035644, "isDeleted": false, "id": "gh9myo24w8kk", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "x": 156, "y": 627, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "width": 708, "height": 240, "seed": 1945755307, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "\u2022 Onboarding + personalizaci\u00f3n IA (/api/onboard, /api/personalize)\n\u2022 Generaci\u00f3n de contenido (crear-curso)\n\u2022 Test de conocimiento + badges (/api/exam)\n\u2022 Coach dashboard + ranking de equipo (/api/coach)\n\u2022 Progreso, mis cursos, tracking (/api/progress, /api/track)\n\u2022 Panel admin: dashboard, insights, cola, equipo, settings\n\u2022 Auth/usuarios, feedback, push, captaci\u00f3n de leads\n\u2022 Tope de coste diario de IA (engine settings)", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 Onboarding + personalizaci\u00f3n IA (/api/onboard, /api/personalize)\n\u2022 Generaci\u00f3n de contenido (crear-curso)\n\u2022 Test de conocimiento + badges (/api/exam)\n\u2022 Coach dashboard + ranking de equipo (/api/coach)\n\u2022 Progreso, mis cursos, tracking (/api/progress, /api/track)\n\u2022 Panel admin: dashboard, insights, cola, equipo, settings\n\u2022 Auth/usuarios, feedback, push, captaci\u00f3n de leads\n\u2022 Tope de coste diario de IA (engine settings)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 11}, {"type": "rectangle", "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1975047827, "isDeleted": false, "id": "is2n00iuxuib", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "x": 910, "y": 577, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5", "width": 740, "height": 300, "seed": 957030531, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1993372379, "isDeleted": false, "id": "z5fbrpjm2wfd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "x": 926, "y": 591, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "width": 708, "height": 26, "seed": 219982118, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "FALTA POR CONSTRUIR (mejoras de desarrollo)", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": null, "originalText": "FALTA POR CONSTRUIR (mejoras de desarrollo)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 14}, {"type": "text", "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1816020029, "isDeleted": false, "id": "vxnoju6ej9hi", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "x": 926, "y": 627, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "width": 708, "height": 240, "seed": 180096429, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "\u2022 Validaci\u00f3n de caso pr\u00e1ctico con r\u00fabrica + doble revisi\u00f3n (nivel 3)\n\u2022 Cascada de roles: coach de coaches, Inspirador, equipos de empuje\n\u2022 Motor de reglas de recompensa por empresa (disparador -> resultado)\n\u2022 Config. de empresa: t\u00edtulos, certificados verificables, compensaci\u00f3n\n\u2022 Panel ROI real: cobertura, riesgo, coste de formar, tiempo a autonom\u00eda\n\u2022 Gate de progreso/coste ligado a validaci\u00f3n (ampliar el tope actual)\n\u2022 Antifraude de la cascada: topes, multiplicadores, auditor\u00eda por muestreo\n\u2022 L\u00ednea base del piloto + garant\u00eda comercial\n\u2022 FUNDAE: tutorizaci\u00f3n + control de tiempo/evaluaci\u00f3n justificable\n\u2022 Cobro por plan + Boomatik como entidad organizadora", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 Validaci\u00f3n de caso pr\u00e1ctico con r\u00fabrica + doble revisi\u00f3n (nivel 3)\n\u2022 Cascada de roles: coach de coaches, Inspirador, equipos de empuje\n\u2022 Motor de reglas de recompensa por empresa (disparador -> resultado)\n\u2022 Config. de empresa: t\u00edtulos, certificados verificables, compensaci\u00f3n\n\u2022 Panel ROI real: cobertura, riesgo, coste de formar, tiempo a autonom\u00eda\n\u2022 Gate de progreso/coste ligado a validaci\u00f3n (ampliar el tope actual)\n\u2022 Antifraude de la cascada: topes, multiplicadores, auditor\u00eda por muestreo\n\u2022 L\u00ednea base del piloto + garant\u00eda comercial\n\u2022 FUNDAE: tutorizaci\u00f3n + control de tiempo/evaluaci\u00f3n justificable\n\u2022 Cobro por plan + Boomatik como entidad organizadora", "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 11}, {"type": "rectangle", "version": 1, "versionNonce": 217714181, "isDeleted": false, "id": "aep1lcdpb6sx", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "x": 1680, "y": 577, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "width": 740, "height": 300, "seed": 1841080150, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "version": 1, "versionNonce": 412812530, "isDeleted": false, "id": "qkh830ty5jpy", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "x": 1696, "y": 591, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "width": 708, "height": 26, "seed": 1393951918, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "ESTRATEGIA DE ADOPCI\u00d3N \u2192 ROI", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": null, "originalText": "ESTRATEGIA DE ADOPCI\u00d3N \u2192 ROI", "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 14}, {"type": "text", "version": 1, "versionNonce": 136144738, "isDeleted": false, "id": "c91cp3k21v7j", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "x": 1696, "y": 627, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "width": 708, "height": 240, "seed": 711786909, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "1. Entra por un equipo, no por toda la plantilla.\n2. Onboarding define por qu\u00e9/para qu\u00e9 -> ruta a su puesto.\n3. Aprende con lo suyo y DEMUESTRA en un caso real.\n4. El responsable valida -> mete al mando en el bucle.\n5. El que domina forma al siguiente -> el saber se queda y se multiplica.\n6. El panel convierte capacidad en ROI: cobertura, riesgo,\n    coste de formar, tiempo a autonom\u00eda.\n7. Garant\u00eda: si no ves la medici\u00f3n, no pagas.\n8. FUNDAE baja el coste; Boomatik se usa a s\u00ed misma = caso 0.\n\nRegla de voz: a la web solo salen RESULTADOS, nunca la mec\u00e1nica.", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": null, "originalText": "1. Entra por un equipo, no por toda la plantilla.\n2. Onboarding define por qu\u00e9/para qu\u00e9 -> ruta a su puesto.\n3. Aprende con lo suyo y DEMUESTRA en un caso real.\n4. El responsable valida -> mete al mando en el bucle.\n5. El que domina forma al siguiente -> el saber se queda y se multiplica.\n6. El panel convierte capacidad en ROI: cobertura, riesgo,\n    coste de formar, tiempo a autonom\u00eda.\n7. Garant\u00eda: si no ves la medici\u00f3n, no pagas.\n8. FUNDAE baja el coste; Boomatik se usa a s\u00ed misma = caso 0.\n\nRegla de voz: a la web solo salen RESULTADOS, nunca la mec\u00e1nica.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 11}], "appState": {"gridSize": null, "viewBackgroundColor": "#fbfbfd"}, "files": {}}